    "title": "Lafayette Cemetery No. 1 Reopens Oct. 1 After 7 Years, Bans Ghost Tours - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Erica Campos ,\n1 days ago Lafayette Cemetery No. 1 in New Orleans is set to reopen to the public on October 1, ending a seven-year closure — but visitors will no longer be able to wander in on their own, and theatrical ghost tours are banned entirely. The Garden District landmark, final resting place for thousands of New Orleanians, has sat off-limits to non-family visitors since 2019, when the city closed it partly for repairs and partly to address family concerns. Read full article\n1",
